Consent Agenda) carried (Mayor Richard L. Kaysen, Official Voting Delegate; City Clerk Carol
Intlekofer, Alternate Delegate).
Announcement was made of the Appointment of Barry Sims to the Visit Cheyenne Board
to be confirmed May 27, 2014.
Announcement was made of the Re-Appointments of Amiee Reese and Scott French to the
Visit Cheyenne Board, and Larry Atwell to the Cheyenne/Laramie County Economic Development
Joint Powers Board, to be confirmed May 27, 2014.
Announcement was made that due to the Memorial Day Holiday on Monday, May 26, 2014,
the regularly scheduled meeting of the Governing Body will instead be held on Tuesday, May 27,
2014 beginning at 6:00 p.m. in City Council Chambers, Municipal Building, 2101 O’Neil Avenue,
Cheyenne, Wyoming.
            Announcement was made of a Public Hearing to be held May 27, 2014 at 6:00 p.m. in City
Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming, to receive public comments
regarding the intent of the City of Cheyenne to submit an application to the Wyoming Business
Council’s Business Ready Community, Community Readiness Grant Program,  for the Christensen
Railroad Overpass and Corridor Project.
There being no further business to come before the governing body, the meeting was
officially adjourned  at 6:48 p.m.
